    (GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Cusp.FibreMove.fibreLat_move E H Or.𝔐.X Or.𝔐.X Or.𝔐.t Or.𝔐.t (𝟙 _) g Λ R R' z).2 hP hH
      (fun a x => by simpa using hB a (star x)) hF
  exact ⟨g, Λ, i₁, i₂, R', fun τ => (starRingEnd ℂ).comp (σ τ), hF',
